    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MOLLY: Come on, Mother, don't do this Garbo thing, nobody recognizes you.\nLILLY: That's what you think, The Cockroach has been following me for three blocks,\nMOLLY: Who's the Cockroach?\nLILLY: That greasy little paparazzi, the one who took the \"fat\" picture of me...don't turn around!",
      "LILLY: What?! Oh, I, uh...excuse me one moment.\nROWENA: Lillian, wait... Congratulations. You're looking much better.\nLILLY: I find any attempt you might make to talk to me in the worst possible taste.\nROWENA: Lilly, please. It's all so many years ago...",
      "MOLLY: Right now! If you can't do it, go outside and cool it off!\nLILLY: You're asking us to \"take it outside?\"\nMOLLY: Just go! Please!\nMOLLY: This is a bride's request on her wedding day. Go outside, this minute, and don't come back in here until you can hold a civil conversation! …",
      "MOLLY: Rowena, what~~\nROWENA: I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I know it's your honeymoon, I just... can we go upstairs and talk?\nMOLLY: No! They're ... uh ... vacuuming. Really loud, we can't-~",
      "MOLLY: Look, we just assumed they went home and apologized to both of you.\nROWENA: Well, they're gone with the fucking wind!"
    ]
  },
